<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head', { title }) %>
    <style>
      html, body {
        min-height: 100%;
      }
      body {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 32px 16px;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(103, 0, 253, 0.16), transparent 35%),
          radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(228, 252, 28, 0.12), transparent 30%),
          var(--bg-main);
      }
      .auth-error-shell {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 460px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .auth-error-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.04));
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }
      .auth-error-logo {
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
        object-fit: contain;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32));
      }
      .auth-error-title {
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      .auth-error-msg {
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .auth-error-back a {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }
      .auth-error-back a:hover {
        color: #fff;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="auth-error-shell">
      <section class="auth-error-card">
        <img class="auth-error-logo" src="/assets/img/liga.png" alt="Logo RCL" />
        <h1 class="auth-error-title">Acceso denegado</h1>
        <p class="auth-error-msg">
          Tu cuenta de Discord no pertenece al servidor de la liga.<br>
          Solo los miembros del servidor pueden acceder.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="https://discord.gg/NEyYRzCMc8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          Unirse al servidor
        </a>
        <div class="auth-error-back" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
          <a href="/">← Volver a la web</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
